      "content": "it just feels like even if i say \"stop\" or try to slow down, everything just collapses. the interest rates, the landlord, the bills... it’s like the math of my life is just broken. there is no way to win. do you think it's actually possible to ever break out of this, or is it just a trap for everyone?",
